# firmware/ is private operational material — pulled stock bundles, partition
# dumps, the live endpoint working copy (ENDPOINTS.md). Three files inside are
# deliberately public and tracked: the AdGuard how-to, its per-client
# blocklist for the TV, and the on-TV firewall policy source (tvfw, deployed
# to /var/local/tvfw by hand).
firmware/*
!firmware/ADGUARD_APPLY.md
!firmware/adguard-blocklist.txt
!firmware/tvfw

# private research working notes; the public record lives in docs/research/
/research/

